speechtext:
Subclause (l)(b) of clause 3 reads:
(b) for the training of persons in technical and vocational courses given in regular secondary schools in the province where such training is given as a part of the regular secondary school program;
My question is: are there to be, as it were, two sections of this technical assistance and vocational training; that is, does this bill provide for the continuance of the training in secondary or high schools and then separate institutions and schools for the technical training and trade training of unskilled people who have left high schools?
